{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rom-9-1","title":"Romans 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul is sorry for the Jews. 7 All of Abraham not of the promise. 18 God's sovereignty. 25 The calling of the Gentiles and rejecting of the Jews, foretold. 32 The cause of the Jews' stumbling.</p>\n<p>I say. 1:9; 2Co 1:23; 11:31; 12:19; Ga 1:20; Php 1:8; 1Th 2:5; 1Ti 2:7; 5:21 my conscience. 2:15; 8:16; 2Co 1:12; 1Ti 1:5; 1Jo 3:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-2","title":"Romans 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>10:1; 1Sa 15:35; Ps 119:136; Isa 66:10; Jer 9:1; 13:17; La 1:12 La 3:48,49,51; Eze 9:4; Lu 19:41-44; Php 3:18; Re 11:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-3","title":"Romans 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I could. Ex 32:32 were. De 21:23; Jos 6:17,18; 1Sa 14:24,44; Ga 1:8; 3:10,13 accursed. or, separated. my kinsmen. 11:1; Ge 29:14; Es 8:6; Ac 7:23-26; 13:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-4","title":"Romans 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>are Israelites. 6; Ge 32:28; Ex 19:3-6; De 7:6; Ps 73:1; Isa 41:8; 46:3; Joh 1:47 the adoption. Ex 4:22; De 14:1; Jer 31:9,20; Ho 11:1 and the glory. Nu 7:89; 1Sa 4:21,22; 1Ki 8:11; Ps 63:2; 78:61; 90:16; Isa 60:19 covenants. or, testaments. Ge 15:18; 17:2,7,10; Ex 24:7,8; 34:27; De 29:1; 31:16; Ne 13:29 Ps 89:3,34; Jer 31:33; 33:20-25; Ac 3:25; Heb 8:6-10 the giving. 3:2; Ne 9:13,14; Ps 147:19; Eze 20:11,12; Joh 1:17 the service. Ex 12:25; Isa 5:2; Mt 21:33; Heb 9:3,10 promises. Lu 1:54,55,69-75; Ac 2:39; 3:25,26; 13:32,33; Eph 2:12; Heb 6:13-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-5","title":"Romans 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>are the fathers. 11:28; De 10:15 of whom. 1:3; Ge 12:3; 49:10; Isa 7:14; 11:1; Mt 1:1-17; Lu 3:23-38; 2Ti 2:8 Re 22:16 who is. 10:12; Ps 45:6; 103:19; Isa 9:6,7; Jer 23:5,6; Mic 5:2; Joh 1:1-3 Joh 10:30; Ac 20:28; Php 2:6-11; Col 1:16; 1Ti 3:16; Heb 1:8-13 1Jo 5:20 blessed. 1:25; Ps 72:19; 2Co 11:31; 1Ti 6:15 Amen. De 27:15-26; 1Ki 1:36; 1Ch 16:36; Ps 41:13; 89:52; 106:48; Jer 28:6 Mt 6:13; 28:20; 1Co 14:16; Re 1:18; 5:14; 22:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-6","title":"Romans 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>as though. 3:3; 11:1,2; Nu 23:19; Isa 55:11; Mt 24:35; Joh 10:35; 2Ti 2:13 Heb 6:17,18 they are not. 2:28,29; 4:12-16; Joh 1:47; Ga 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-7","title":"Romans 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>because. Lu 3:8; 16:24,25,30; Joh 8:37-39; Php 3:3 In Isaac. Ge 21:12; Heb 11:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-8","title":"Romans 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>They which. 4:11-16; Ga 4:22-31 are counted. Ge 31:15; Ps 22:30; 87:6; Joh 1:13; Ga 3:26-29; 4:28; 1Jo 3:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-9","title":"Romans 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>At this time. Ge 17:21; 18:10,14; 21:2 Sarah. Heb 11:11,12,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-10","title":"Romans 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>not only. 5:3,11; Lu 16:26 but when. Ge 25:21-23 Rebekah.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-11","title":"Romans 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the children. 4:17; Ps 51:5; Eph 2:3 that the. 8:28-30; Isa 14:24,26,27; 23:9; 46:10,11; Jer 51:29; Eph 1:9-11 Eph 3:11; 2Ti 1:9 according. 11:5,7; Eph 1:4,5; 1Th 1:4; 2Pe 1:10 not of works. 11:6; Eph 2:9; Tit 3:5 but of. 8:28; 1Th 2:12; 2Th 2:13,14; 1Pe 5:10; Re 17:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-12","title":"Romans 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>The elder. or, The greater. Ge 25:22,23; 2Sa 8:14; 1Ki 22:47 younger. or, lesser.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-13","title":"Romans 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Jacob. Mal 1:2,3 hated. Ge 29:31,33; De 21:15; Pr 13:24; Mt 10:37; Lu 14:26; Joh 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-14","title":"Romans 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>shall. 3:1,5 Is there unrighteousness. 2:5; 3:5,6; Ge 18:25; De 32:4; 2Ch 19:7; Job 8:3; 34:10-12,18,19 Job 35:2; Ps 92:15; 145:17; Jer 12:1; Re 15:3,4; 16:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-15","title":"Romans 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I will have. 16,18,19; Ex 33:19; 34:6,7; Isa 27:11; Mic 7:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-16","title":"Romans 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>11; Ge 27:1-4,9-14; Ps 110:3; Isa 65:1; Mt 11:25,26; Lu 10:21 Joh 1:12,13; 3:8; 1Co 1:26-31; Eph 2:4,5; Php 2:13; 2Th 2:13,14 Tit 3:3-5; Jas 1:18; 1Pe 2:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-17","title":"Romans 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>For. 11:4; Ga 3:8,22; 4:30 Even. Ex 9:16 I raised. 1Sa 2:7,8; Es 4:14; Isa 10:5,6; 45:1-3; Jer 27:6,7; Da 4:22 Da 5:18-21 that. Ex 10:1,2; 14:17,18; 15:14,15; 18:10,11; Jos 2:9,10; 9:9; 1Sa 4:8 Ps 83:17,18; Pr 16:4; Isa 37:20 that my. Joh 17:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-18","title":"Romans 9:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>hath. 15,16; 5:20,21; Eph 1:6 will he. 1:24-28; 11:7,8; Ex 4:21; 7:13; De 2:30; Jos 11:20; Isa 63:17 Mt 13:14,15; Ac 28:26-28; 2Th 2:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-19","title":"Romans 9:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Thou. 3:8; 1Co 15:12,35; Jas 1:13 Why doth. 3:5-7; Ge 50:20; 2Ch 20:6; Job 9:12-15,19; 23:13,14; Ps 76:10 Isa 10:6,7; 46:10,11; Da 4:35; Mr 14:21; Ac 2:23; 4:27,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-20","title":"Romans 9:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>O man. 2:1; Mic 6:8; 1Co 7:16; Jas 2:20 who art. Job 33:13; 36:23; 38:2,3; 40:2,5,8; 42:2-6; Mt 20:15 repliest. or, answerest again. Job 16:3; Tit 2:9 or, disputes with God? 1Co 1:20; 1Ti 6:5 Shall. Isa 29:16; 45:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-21","title":"Romans 9:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the potter. 11,18; Pr 16:4; Isa 64:8; Jer 18:3-6 one vessel. 22,23; Jer 22:28; Ho 8:8; Ac 9:15; 2Ti 2:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-22","title":"Romans 9:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>willing. 17; 1:18; 2:4,5; Ex 9:16; Ps 90:11; Pr 16:4; Re 6:16,17 endured. Nu 14:11,18; Ps 50:21,22; Ec 8:11,12; La 3:22; 1Pe 3:20; 2Pe 2:3,9 2Pe 3:8,9,15; Jude 1:4; Re 6:9-11 the vessels.The Apostle, by employing the appellation of the vessels of wrath, carries on the similitude of the potter, by which he had illustrated the sovereignty of God.</p>\n<p>21; 1Th 5:9; 2Ti 2:20 fitted. or, made up. Ge 15:16; Mt 23:31-33; 1Th 2:16; 1Pe 2:8; Jude 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-23","title":"Romans 9:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>might. 2:4; 5:20,21; Eph 1:6-8,18; 2:4,7,10; 3:8,16; Col 1:27; 2Th 1:10-12 he had afore. 1Ch 29:18; Lu 1:17; Eph 2:3-5; Col 1:12; 1Th 5:9; 2Th 2:13,14 2Ti 2:21; Tit 3:3-7; 1Pe 1:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-24","title":"Romans 9:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>whom. 8:28-30; 1Co 1:9; Heb 3:1; 1Pe 5:10; Re 19:9 not of the Jews. 3:29,30; 4:11,12; 10:12; 11:11-13; 15:8-16; Ge 49:10; Ps 22:27 Ac 13:47,48; 15:14; 21:17-20; Ga 3:28; Eph 2:11-13; 3:6-8; Col 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-25","title":"Romans 9:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>in Osee. Ho 1:1,2 Hosea. I will call. Ho 2:23; 1Pe 2:10 beloved. 1:7; Eze 16:8; Joh 16:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-26","title":"Romans 9:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>And it. Ho 1:9,10 there shall. 8:16; Isa 43:6; Joh 11:52; 2Co 6:18; Ga 3:26; 1Jo 3:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-27","title":"Romans 9:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Esaias. Isa 1:1 Isaiah. though. Isa 10:20-23 a remnant. 11:4-6; Ezr 9:8,14; Isa 1:9; 10:20,21; 11:11; 24:13; Jer 5:10 Eze 6:8; Mic 5:3-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-28","title":"Romans 9:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>work. or, account. and cut. Isa 28:22; 30:12-14; Da 9:26,27; Mt 24:21 in righteousness. Ps 9:8; 65:5; Isa 5:16; Ac 17:31; Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-29","title":"Romans 9:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Except. Isa 1:9; 6:13; La 3:22 Sabaoth. Jas 5:4 we had been. Ge 19:24,25; Isa 13:19; Jer 49:18; 50:40; La 4:6; Am 4:11; Zep 2:6 Sodom, Gomorrah. 2Pe 2:6; Jude 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-30","title":"Romans 9:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>shall. 14; 3:5 the Gentiles. 1:18-32; 4:11; 10:20; Isa 65:1,2; 1Co 6:9-11; Eph 2:12; 4:17-19 1Pe 4:3 followed. 31; Pr 15:9; 21:21; Isa 51:1; 1Ti 6:11 even the righteousness. 1:17; 3:22; 4:9,11,13,22; 5:1; 10:10; Ga 3:8; 5:5; Php 3:9; Heb 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-31","title":"Romans 9:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>followed. 30-32; 10:2-4; Ga 3:21; Php 3:6 hath. 3:20; 4:14,15; 11:7; Ga 3:10,11; 5:3,4; Jas 2:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-32","title":"Romans 9:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>Because. 4:16; 10:3; Mt 19:16-20; Joh 6:27-29; Ac 16:30-34; 1Jo 5:9-12 they stumbled. 11:11; Mt 13:57; Lu 2:34; 7:23; 1Co 1:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-9-33","title":"Romans 9:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Behold. Ps 118:22; Isa 8:14,15; 28:16; Mt 21:42,44; 1Pe 2:7,8 and whosoever. 5:5; 10:11; Ps 25:2,3,20; Isa 45:17; 54:4; Joe 2:26,27; Php 1:20 2Ti 1:12; 1Jo 2:28 ashamed. or, confounded. 1Pe 2:6</p>"}]}